                "kind": "PUBLIC HEARING / ACTION ITEM",
                "title": "An ordinance of Eagle Mountain City, Utah updating the Culinary Water Impact Fee Facility Plan (IFFP).",
                "time": "",
                "background": "(Presented by City Engineer, Vince Hogge) Consideration of an update to the Culinary Water IFFP. This update adds the Spring Run/Talons Cove area to the IFFP which adds improvements needed to the culinary water system to handle water demand from this area. The IFFP also includes updated cost estimates adding the projects for the Spring Run/Talons Cove area and updating costs for future projects based on the rising costs of current construction projects.",
