                "title": "An ordinance of Eagle Mountain City, Utah updating the Wastewater Master Plan and the Wastewater Impact Fee Facility Plan (IFFP).",
                "time": "",
                "background": "(Presented by City Engineer, Vince Hogge) Consideration of an update to the Wastewater Master Plan and the Wastewater IFFP. This update adds the Spring Run/Talons Cove area to the Master Plan and IFFP which adds improvements needed to the wastewater system to handle sewer flows from this area. The IFFP also includes updated cost estimates adding the projects for the Spring Run/Talons Cove area and updating costs for future projects based on the rising costs of current construction projects.",
